x-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>, is MAR; every other is MNAR; and all assign the\nobserved data the same likelihood.</p></li>\n</ol>\n</div>","file":"ch41-missing-data/01-mechanisms.html"}